      "text": "Nephi1 does not excuse himself because of other men, but because of own weakness, 1 Ne. 19:6. Nephites seek to excuse themselves in committing whoredoms because of David and Solomon, Jacob 2:23. Isabel stole away hearts of many, but this is no excuse for Corianton, Alma 39:4. do not endeavor to excuse yourself by denying justice of God, Alma 42:30.",
